    "teach_5": {
      "id": "teach_5",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The same idea works from still-water and one river speed.\n\nStill water = 9 km/hr\nUpstream = 7 km/hr\n\nSo current = 9 − 7 = 2 km/hr, and downstream = 9 + 2 = 11 km/hr.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
